45:["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"Skip","className":"rounded-md bg-surface-secondary px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-foreground"}]}],": no fetch. Skip with no resident value yields ",["$","code",null,{"children":"StoreError.Missing","className":"rounded-md bg-surface-secondary px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-foreground"}]," (",["$","code",null,{"children":"get","className":"rounded-md bg-surface-secondary px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-foreground"}]," throws,\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"stream","className":"rounded-md bg-surface-secondary px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-foreground"}]," emits ",["$","code",null,{"children":"Error","className":"rounded-md bg-surface-secondary px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-foreground"}],")."],"className":"leading-7 text-foreground"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"Fetch(servesResidentWhileFetching)","className":"rounded-md bg-surface-secondary px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-foreground"}]}],": an unconditional fetch, optionally serving the\nresident value while it runs."],"className":"leading-7 text-foreground"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"Conditional(etag, servesResidentWhileFetching)","className":"rounded-md bg-surface-secondary px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-foreground"}]}],": a conditional fetch for the recorded\nETag."],"className":"leading-7 text-foreground"}],"\n"],"className":"my-4 list-disc space-y-2 ps-6 marker:text-muted"}]
46:["$","p",null,{"children":["A ",["$","code",null,{"children":"Conditional","className":"rounded-md bg-surface-secondary px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-foreground"}]," plan is how ETags reach a seam fetcher: the fetcher receives the ETag the plan\nselected, and a ",["$","code",null,{"children":"FetcherResult.NotModified","className":"rounded-md bg-surface-secondary px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-foreground"}]," response comes back to collectors as exactly one\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"Revalidated","className":"rounded-md bg-surface-secondary px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-foreground"}]," frame, with the resident value's age, never a redundant ",["$","code",null,{"children":"Data","className":"rounded-md bg-surface-secondary px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-foreground"}]," frame, and clears\nstaleness. Deep coverage of conditional fetching and custom validators belongs to the fetchers\n",["$","a",null,{"href":"/docs/store6/guides/fetchers","children":"guide","className":"font-medium text-accent-strong underline decoration-separator decoration-1 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:decoration-accent-strong focus-visible:rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"}]," and the ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/docs/store6/guides/extending","children":"extending-Store guide","className":"font-medium text-accent-strong underline decoration-separator decoration-1 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:decoration-accent-strong focus-visible:rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"}],"."],"className":"my-4 leading-7 text-foreground"}]
47:["$","$L56",null,{"id":"coming-from-store-5","children":"Coming from Store 5"}]
48:["$","p",null,{"children":["Store 5 asked you to supply a ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/docs/concepts/store5/validator","children":"Validator","className":"font-medium text-accent-strong underline decoration-separator decoration-1 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:decoration-accent-strong focus-visible:rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"}],", a hook the store\ncalled to decide whether cached data was still good, defaulting to \"always valid\" when absent.\nStore 6 absorbs that job natively: per-call policies say how fresh each read must be, durable\ninvalidation marks data stale from the write side, and the ",["$","code",null,{"children":"FreshnessValidator","className":"rounded-md bg-surface-secondary px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-foreground"}]," seam remains for\nthe rare custom case."],"className":"my-4 leading-7 text-foreground"}]
